# Only what the Dockerfile copies is sent to the Docker daemon; the rest of the repository
# (docs, tests, examples, the matRad checkout, virtual environments) would be hundreds of MB.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!pyRadPlan
!packaging/container/entrypoint.sh
!packaging/briefcase/scripts/collect_licenses.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
